    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just the loss. It's the hollow feeling. Like the world is just a stage and the lights have already gone down. Even the sword I carry feels heavier now, like it's waiting for something. I look at the edge of it and it's the only thing that feels real in this darkness. It feels like the final chapter was written a long time ago, and I'm just... lingering in the epilogue. Does a hero even deserve a sequel when everything is destroyed?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
